  <h1>Compared with the alternatives</h1>
  <p>This page sets message-cp beside Claude Code's built-in cross-session messaging, one hosted service (AgentDM) and three open-source MCP servers that let agents message each other, and says when each is the better choice. Every claim about another product links to its source. Checked on 23 October 2026; these projects change quickly, so check their sources before you decide.</p>

